    "summary": "Use it in the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) as an enemy unit picks a **KILLER** unit of yours as its target; that unit is the target.\n\nWhenever a **KILLER** model in it is **destroyed** while the unit has not yet been **selected to fight** in this phase, roll a D6:\n\n- On a 1, 1 **[mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** is dealt to the attacking enemy unit.\n- On a 2+, leave the model on the battlefield; remove it after the unit has fought or when the phase ends, whichever comes first.",
